1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,154
What still needs fixing before this system goes to production?

2
00:00:03,154 --> 00:00:09,857
First, keep each nonce as long as its timestamp is accepted, so a signed request can never be replayed later.

3
00:00:09,857 --> 00:00:15,619
Second, check the signature before spending the nonce, so nobody can burn other merchants' nonces.

4
00:00:15,619 --> 00:00:20,857
Third, require an approved KYB before any merchant can be activated.

5
00:00:20,857 --> 00:00:24,107
Fourth, add payment limits for each sales point.

6
00:00:24,107 --> 00:00:29,107
Each one is your exercise, with a failing test waiting for you to make it pass.

7
00:00:29,107 --> 00:00:32,464
Next, taking the whole system to Kubernetes.

